// What a cave does (map.cave), as in the original game:
// - gift: Link takes one item (or the rupees), and the cave is empty from then on
// - shop: Link buys one item; the merchant and his items vanish until Link comes back
// - money_game: each rupee costs 10 to play and hides a gain or a loss
// - pay_to_talk: what Link pays decides what he hears
// - potion_shop: a shop that only opens once Link has shown the letter
// - door_repair: Link pays for the door he bombed when he comes in, and the cave is empty from then on
